{"id":"vod_sn_35580","vodId":"35580","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"热带雨林的爆笑生活","name_cn":"热带雨林的爆笑生活","date":"2001-01-01","year":"2001","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/d93fba62a70f57e67bb73f0fba9e2e7c.jpg"},"summary":"小学生小晴与未婚妈妈维达两个人快乐地住在热带雨林里，过着简单而欢乐的生活。一天，酒醉夜归的维达带回来一个美丽的小女孩，她叫阿布。本以为将更加快乐的生活，却在第二天开始了翻天覆地的改变。小晴发现，昨晚的阿布完全是伪装出来的。实际上，阿布不仅脾气古怪，爱捉弄小晴，并且还有一个什么都能吞噬的胃。而小晴从未谋面的爸爸，似乎也要来到这个热带雨林。充满爆笑与不可思议事件人物的热带雨林，因为阿布的到来，而变得与众不同起来。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:35:56","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pkGsR4Qh8d1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NMxUFw40JM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/q2YsUyDXWx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2ZLMYTzKGh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VD6Se7nPwz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MWtdSGQquE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WANWQWxpDg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sbwrm9HBmP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/F8gzUp18KT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VTzvtiCWJq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/abfM1yTU611/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2HbL7P78Yr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qHTWcM7Sgg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RQE8W4QxjP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kGkJdAh8HL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"